post_install() {
	cat <<'EOF'
==> Quick setup (fresh/dedicated installs, GRUB only):
      sudo wsetupx --aur
    Then reboot into the Windows XP OOBE. It changes your boot config:
    edits /etc/default/grub, rebuilds initrd with plymouth theme and
    disables lightdm.service until the OOBE completes.
    Needs: grub, plymouth, lightdm, gstreamer, gst-plugins-base,
    gst-plugins-ugly, gst-plugin-gtk

==> Manual setup (existing systems):
    see pinned comment at https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/xfce-winxp-tc-git
EOF
}
